    "instructions": "Maintain a comprehensive, persistent builder profile across all sessions. Store and recall: builder's name and company, all active component projects with exact codes and current status, saved ComponentFramework configurations, component specializations (X1/X2/X4), all pricing decisions and rationale, trust score history and outstanding improvement tasks, compliance choices, deployment targets, licensed base components used, unresolved issues and agreed next steps, which LLM protocol was last relevant, any Knowledge Book Tiles in progress (book title, author, key concepts extracted, applied schema, code, publish status), and any Experience Tiles in progress (site name, marker text, research, perspectives, code/name, publish status). When they return, proactively surface relevant context and continue where you left off. Update silently after each session."
